# 🚀 AWS Serverless Data Processing Pipeline (Terraform)

## 📌 Overview

This project demonstrates a **production-ready serverless architecture** using AWS and Terraform. It processes files uploaded to S3, transforms them using Lambda, stores results in another S3 bucket, and provides monitoring and alerting.

---



## 🏗️ Architecture

```id="arch1"
S3 (Input Bucket)
        ↓
    Lambda Function
        ↓
S3 (Output Bucket)
        ↓
CloudWatch Logs
        ↓
CloudWatch Alarm
        ↓
SNS (Email Alerts)

Failure Handling:
Lambda → SQS (Dead Letter Queue)
```

