## 🚀 Setup Instructions

### 1️⃣ Clone Repository

```id="cmd1"
git clone https://github.com/your-username/aws-serverless-data-pipeline.git
cd AWS-PROJECT-1/terraform
```

---

### 2️⃣ Configure Variables

Update `terraform.tfvars`:

```id="cmd2"
lambda_role_arn  = "your-role-arn"
lambda_role_name = "your-role-name"

input_bucket_name  = "your-input-bucket"
output_bucket_name = "your-output-bucket"

queue_name   = "your-dlq-name"
alert_email  = "your-email@gmail.com"
```

---

### 3️⃣ Initialize Terraform

```id="cmd3"
terraform init
```

---

### 4️⃣ Deploy Infrastructure

```id="cmd4"
terraform apply
```

---

### 5️⃣ Confirm SNS Subscription

* Check your email
* Click **Confirm Subscription**

---

## 🧪 Testing

### ✔ Upload File to S3

```id="cmd5"
aws s3 cp test.csv s3://your-input-bucket/input/test.csv
```

---

### ✔ Expected Results

* Lambda triggered automatically
* Output file created in output S3 bucket
* Logs available in CloudWatch
* Email alert on failure
* Message sent to DLQ (SQS)

---

## 🔐 IAM Permissions Required

Lambda role must include:

* `s3:GetObject`
* `s3:PutObject`
* `sqs:SendMessage`
* `logs:*`

